<mxCell id="n33" value="STRENGTH. One idempotent core (apply_booking_action) shared by both entry points; each transport does its own authorization first. Matches doc 05/06. The retired machi approval branch is kept only for pre-cutover rows. No correctness gap found here — verified by test_pwa_accept_shares_idempotent_core_with_whatsapp." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;size=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="200" width="300" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
